  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This is a version of PDFsharp and MigraDoc compatible with .NET 8 and higher.\nThe package ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc’ can be used on any platform including Windows and Linux. The Target Frameworks are ‘net8.0’, ‘net9.0’, ‘net10.0’ and ‘netstandard2.0’.\nThe packages ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc-GDI’ and ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc-WPF’ can be used under Windows only. The Target Frameworks are ‘net8.0-windows’, ‘net9.0-windows’, ‘net10.0-windows’ and ‘net462’.\nSee the project docs site for further information:\nhttps://docs.pdfsharp.net/link/readme-v7.0.html",
